   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I just want to clarify my question here. I am not interested in the coverage of just the CpG sites(which methyl kit provides). But other regions as well. What I need is to do something similar to the <b>figure1 A.B</b> of the paper below:</div><div><i><br></i></div><div><i>Base-Pair Resolution DNA Methylation Sequencing Reveals Profoundly Divergent Epigenetic Landscapes in Acute Myeloid Leukemia</i><br></div><div><i><a href=\"http://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article?id=10.1371/journal.pgen.1002781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article?id%3D10.1371/journal.pgen.1002781&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232242817000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_72x5Vfz8t85PNdNTLeh_\">http://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article?id=10.1371/journal.pgen.1002781</a><br></i></div><div><i><br></i></div><div>I would really appreciate your help in this</div><div>Thank you</div><div>Linda</div><div><br></div><br><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Jul 11, 2017 at 8:29 AM, Altuna Akalin <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aak...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div></div></div>"
